[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
Name=RapidEditor
GenericName=Fast text and code editor
GenericName[zh_CN]=快速文本与源码编辑器
Comment=Multi-tab editor with syntax highlighting and large-file support
Comment[zh_CN]=多标签编辑、语法高亮、支持大文件
